Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,That tiny jeans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,pocket was not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,designed\Nfor loose change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:03.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,It is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:04.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,surviving piece of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:06.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,nineteenth-century\Nworkwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Levi Strauss
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,and Company calls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:09.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,it the watch pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:11.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pocket\Nwatches were common,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:11.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,so the small
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:12.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,pouch carried
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:13.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,and protected one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:14.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,It appeared on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:16.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,the\Noriginal four-pocket
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:17.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,riveted\Nwaist overalls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:17.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,in {\c&H45ADF2&}1873.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:18.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,The second back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:20.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,pocket\Narrived in {\c&H45ADF2&}1901,{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:21.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,making that the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:22.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,actual fifth pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:23.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,So this tiny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:24.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,pocket is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:25.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,working trace of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:27.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,the original\Njeans design.
